takes books filter
# a comment, and the rows under it, write nothing
  p never written
section#shelf.books class="wide"
  h1 Books, filtered by {filter}
  if length books == 0
    p.empty Nothing on the shelf.
  else if filter == ""
    p Every book.
  else
    | Some books, and a brace: \{ kept.
  ul
    each books b ->
      li data-title=b
        = b
        if b == "Emma"
          em  (out)
  img src="/shelf.png" alt="a shelf of {length books}"
